@ pokeemerald data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc: SlateportCity_Text_BushedHikingFromMauville
Hoenn_SlateportCity_Text_BushedHikingFromMauville::
	.string "Whew… I'm just bushed…\p"
	.string "I hiked over from MAUVILLE CITY.\n"
	.string "But, boy, this city's huge.\p"
	.string "If I'd known this, I would've ridden\n"
	.string "my BIKE here.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc: SlateportCity_Text_EveryoneCallsHimCaptStern
Hoenn_SlateportCity_Text_EveryoneCallsHimCaptStern::
	.string "STERN, the fellow who built the\n"
	.string "MUSEUM, also happens to be the leader\l"
	.string "of an undersea exploration team.\p"
	.string "So, everyone calls him CAPT. STERN.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc: SlateportCity_Text_GoingToCompeteInBattleTent
Hoenn_SlateportCity_Text_GoingToCompeteInBattleTent::
	.string "Wroooar! I'm going to compete in\n"
	.string "the BATTLE TENT, too!\p"
	.string "But before that, I need to catch\n"
	.string "some POKéMON!$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc: SlateportCity_Text_VisitedMuseumOften
Hoenn_SlateportCity_Text_VisitedMuseumOften::
	.string "When I was a child, I visited\n"
	.string "the MUSEUM often.\p"
	.string "I used to dream about the mysteries of\n"
	.string "the sea after seeing the exhibits.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc: SlateportCity_Text_SeaweedFullOfLife
Hoenn_SlateportCity_Text_SeaweedFullOfLife::
	.string "Ooh, look at this!\p"
	.string "The seaweed you can get around these\n"
	.string "parts is fresh and full of life.\p"
	.string "Why, it looks like it can even rear up\n"
	.string "and attack!$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc: SlateportCity_Text_HowTownIsBornAndGrows
Hoenn_SlateportCity_Text_HowTownIsBornAndGrows::
	.string "Where the water is clean, the fruits\n"
	.string "of bountiful harvest gather.\p"
	.string "And where people gather, a market\n"
	.string "soon starts.\p"
	.string "That is how a town is born and grows.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc: SlateportCity_Text_SlateportWonderfulPlace
Hoenn_SlateportCity_Text_SlateportWonderfulPlace::
	.string "Shopping where you can breathe the\n"
	.string "scent of the ocean…\p"
	.string "SLATEPORT is such a wonderful place!$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc: SlateportCity_Text_SeaIsSoWet
Hoenn_SlateportCity_Text_SeaIsSoWet::
	.string "The sea is just so vast…\p"
	.string "Could the sea have been made by\n"
	.string "the tears shed by POKéMON?$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc: SlateportCity_Text_SinkOldBoats
Hoenn_SlateportCity_Text_SinkOldBoats::
	.string "Do you know what they do with old\n"
	.string "ships that become too creaky to sail?\p"
	.string "They sink them in the sea so they\n"
	.string "become habitats for POKéMON.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc: SlateportCity_Text_BuyTooMuch
Hoenn_SlateportCity_Text_BuyTooMuch::
	.string "Whenever I visit here, I get carried\n"
	.string "away and buy too much.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc: SlateportCity_Text_BattleTentBuiltRecently
Hoenn_SlateportCity_Text_BattleTentBuiltRecently::
	.string "Recently, a BATTLE TENT was built\n"
	.string "in SLATEPORT.\p"
	.string "GYMS are fun, but the BATTLE TENT's\n"
	.string "awesome in its own way.\p"
	.string "You should go find tough POKéMON\n"
	.string "for the BATTLE TENT!$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc: SlateportCity_Text_GetNameRaterToHelpYou
Hoenn_SlateportCity_Text_GetNameRaterToHelpYou::
	.string "If you want to change your POKéMON's\n"
	.string "nickname, you'll have to get the NAME\l"
	.string "RATER to help you.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc: SlateportCity_Text_CantChangeTradeMonName
Hoenn_SlateportCity_Text_CantChangeTradeMonName::
	.string "Any POKéMON you get in a trade,\n"
	.string "you can't change its nickname.\p"
	.string "The original TRAINER's love for that\n"
	.string "POKéMON is in the nickname.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc: SlateportCity_Text_WonderIfLighthouseStartlesPokemon
Hoenn_SlateportCity_Text_WonderIfLighthouseStartlesPokemon::
	.string "The light of the lighthouse reaches\n"
	.string "dozens of miles away.\p"
	.string "I wonder if it doesn't startle POKéMON\n"
	.string "in the sea.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc: SlateportCity_Text_NameRatersHouseSign
Hoenn_SlateportCity_Text_NameRatersHouseSign::
	.string "NAME RATER'S HOUSE\n"
	.string "“POKéMON nicknames rated.”$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc: SlateportCity_Text_MarketSign
Hoenn_SlateportCity_Text_MarketSign::
	.string "SLATEPORT MARKET\n"
	.string "“Unique items found nowhere else!”$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc: SlateportCity_Text_OceanicMuseumSign
Hoenn_SlateportCity_Text_OceanicMuseumSign::
	.string "“The endless sea sustains\n"
	.string "all life.”\p"
	.string "OCEANIC MUSEUM$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc: SlateportCity_Text_CitySign
Hoenn_SlateportCity_Text_CitySign::
	.string "SLATEPORT CITY\p"
	.string "“The port where people and POKéMON\n"
	.string "cross paths.”$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc: SlateportCity_Text_PokemonFanClubSign
Hoenn_SlateportCity_Text_PokemonFanClubSign::
	.string "POKéMON FAN CLUB\n"
	.string "“Calling all fans of POKéMON!”$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/SlateportCity/scripts.inc: SlateportCity_Text_BattleTentSign
Hoenn_SlateportCity_Text_BattleTentSign::
	.string "BATTLE TENT SLATEPORT SITE\n"
	.string "“Find it! The ultimate POKéMON!”$"
